  "job_B23.3.3.1_20251003_114605": {
    "chunk_text": "ne bi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t na god On xxiiii nihta, \u00fe\u00e6t tacna\u00fe. Toweardlice firhto & brogan & on nigon dagum o\u00f0\u00f0e on x \u00fe\u00e6t by\u00fe geypped, ac wend \u00fein heafod east, On xxvii & on xxviii nihta, \u00fe\u00e6t swefen tacna\u00fe ealne gefean, & ealle angsumnesse & unea\u00f0nesse On xxix nihta, eall swa \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6rre. On xxx nihta, \u00e6r tweigra nihta fyrste \u00fe\u00e6t swefen ag\u00e6\u00f0 butan frecnum \u00feingum..",
